{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:24 2026-09-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:24 2026-09-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:24 2026-09-26 HKT</p><p>今日(26日)是迎月夜，不少人繼續都到維園參觀國際中秋綵燈匯應節，感受中秋氣氛。不過因應「世界綵燈大街」現時參觀人流眾多，旅發局繼續第二日宣布提早截龍。旅發局公布，考慮到公眾安全及秩序，將會在晚上10時停止排隊進入展區。<br/>旅發局又重申，「國際中秋綵燈匯」所有綵燈展出日期將延長至 10 月 4 日，歡迎市民及旅客於其他時段到場欣賞。旅發局衷心感謝市民及旅客的支持及配合，並呼籲參觀人士遵從現場工作人員指示。旅發局會因應現場實際情況，適時於官方網站公布最新安排。</p><img alt=\"維園中秋彩燈會。吳艷玲攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f04469d63b524047d505a13893d72e8/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_192902903_01_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4dea703431adb3144ba94bc370d74f60/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_192902903_02_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4ad5de6afdf9b7b2b074783b9760afa/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_01_1_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/716b47dca15a8f99c784ba4e920b10b9/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_02_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38a2fb5dae107d0d1e88955e08dcdc7a/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_03_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5348c85adf688c34978d11c92e9fc169/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_04_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5154de46f70e6dced9eaa7aa343283d/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_05_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a924363fb3f7c4edd6537702909c4f4/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_06_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc7258e009ead7d4a3cb3a50b0b4d395/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_07_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2763cd74128c0ea03ff87c0f405873dc/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_08_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5487297bda48dfe59d4041979fb25fbb/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_09_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8c4fc4a5dcf92905a0442bc1dd779a2/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_10_-_.jpg\"/><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T13:39:07.387448+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}